/* Legacy theme for CUIMapName, reproducing its Render(): the 166 x 90 name image at physical
   ((W - 166) / 2, 220 * H / 480), unscaled, and on a Gens battle map the 166 x 28 strife banner
   right above it; both at the fade alpha (opacity from C++). Shown 1:1: the original magnified a
   corner of them through texture coordinates meant for padded textures (see UIMapName.cpp). */

body { pointer-events: none; }

#banner { position: absolute; width: 166px; height: 90px; pointer-events: none; }
#name { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 166px; height: 90px; }
#strife { position: absolute; left: 0; top: -28px; width: 166px; height: 28px; }
